ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动发布Seedance 2.0 Mini视频生成模型，单秒生成成本降低50%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Salesforce 斥资 36 亿美元收购 AI 客服平台 Fin 以强化 Agentforce</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek完成逾70亿美元首轮融资，投后估值突破500亿美元大关</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴正式发布具身智能大模型Qwen-Robot系列，包含三款核心模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dfaf2f00690c5d8d207e48031165c659.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月16日，阿里巴巴发布千问具身智能大模型Qwen-Robot系列，旨在为机器人提供理解自然语言、感知三维环境及掌握物理规律的通用底座。该系列包含三款模型：Qwen-RobotManip专注于核心操作，采用统一动作表征，经超38000小时预训练，在拧水龙头及双臂倒薯条等任务中表现优异；Qwen-RobotNav集成任务指令理解、目标搜索及自动驾驶等五大功能，通过“任务自适应观察机制”实现复杂未知空间的高效寻物；Qwen-RobotWorld作为物理世界模型，支持对下一时刻物理状态和动作的预演，确保物理操作精准度。三大模型协同工作，将视觉感知、语言理解与动作决策深度融合，显著增强了机器人在真实生活场景中的任务泛化能力，推动具身智能技术从实验室迈向实际应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达计划发行至少200亿美元债券以扩充算力基础设施建设资金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达于2026年6月15日宣布计划发行至少200亿美元债券，正式加入科技巨头的AI债务融资热潮。此次发债共分七期，期限覆盖2年至30年，最长期限债券收益率较美国国债高出约0.9个百分点。摩根大通、摩根士丹利及高盛担任承销商。这是英伟达自2021年以来首次重返债券市场，融资规模较此前50亿美元大幅提升。公司表示募集资金将用于一般用途及现有债务再融资。在Alphabet、亚马逊等科技巨头纷纷通过债务市场筹集数千亿美元以提升AI计算能力的背景下，英伟达此举旨在巩固现金流，为后续高强度研发及供应链扩张储备弹药。这一动作标志着AI算力竞争已从单纯的技术博弈，全面延伸至资本效率与债务杠杆的深度较量，进一步加剧了全球算力军备竞赛的激烈程度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布Seedance 2.0 Mini视频生成模型，单秒生成成本降低50%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f41b250fa3b0b703c9cfc3896c179fa3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动火山引擎于6月15日正式上线Seedance 2.0 Mini视频生成模型，该模型主打高性价比，旨在满足大规模视频创作需求。作为轻量化版本，Seedance 2.0 Mini在保持高质量输出的同时，生成速度较同系列标准快速版提升2倍。在成本控制方面，以720P规格测算，其单秒视频生成成本降至约0.5元，较标准版降低约50%。该模型计划近期对外开放API服务，重点面向电商内容生产、营销素材批量生成及特效快速制作等场景。通过大幅降低技术门槛与资金投入，Seedance 2.0 Mini将助力企业实现高频次、大批量的视频内容规模化生产，为行业提供更具竞争力的技术解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Salesforce 斥资 36 亿美元收购 AI 客服平台 Fin 以强化 Agentforce</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2f9600dace3c917aa60ddedbd8bfcaf8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Salesforce 正式宣布以 36 亿美元收购 AI 客户服务平台 Fin，旨在通过整合其智能代理技术全面升级企业级 AI 平台 Agentforce。Fin 前身为 Intercom，擅长通过实时聊天、短信、WhatsApp、Slack 及语音电话等多渠道处理客户咨询。Salesforce 首席执行官 Marc Benioff 表示，Fin 的加入将增强 Agentforce 构建自定义 AI 代理的能力，助力企业实现业务流程自动化。Fin 联合创始人兼 CEO Eoghan McCabe 及核心团队将留任，确保产品研发路径的连续性。该交易预计于 Salesforce 2027 财年第四季度完成。此次并购标志着 Salesforce 在智能服务领域的重要布局，通过资本手段强化其在客户体验管理市场的智能代理</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek完成逾70亿美元首轮融资，投后估值突破500亿美元大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b95176ef495da074de7b835cd89d91.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI大模型独角兽DeepSeek日前完成逾70亿美元首轮融资，投后估值超500亿美元。本轮融资采用非常规交易架构，资金注入由CEO梁文锋管理的有限合伙企业，投资者需遵守五年锁定期且不享有表决权，以确保创始人团队对技术路线的绝对控制权。梁文锋个人出资200亿元人民币，腾讯与宁德时代作为战略投资方，计划分别出资100亿元和50亿元人民币。此举打破了一级市场融资沉寂，为DeepSeek后续的前沿模型研发及算力基础设施建设提供了充足财务支持。该融资模式通过创始人高度控盘与产业巨头深度绑定，为开源及原生AI企业在平衡资本引进与治理独立性方面提供了全新的行业范式。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
